<title>NETHERLANDS: Milestone dates for Dutch AEX share index.</title>
<headline>Milestone dates for Dutch AEX share index.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The AEX index of 25 Dutch blue chip shares, launched on January 2, 1983 with a value of 100 points, reached the 900 mark for the first time on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Amsterdam stock exchange published the following list of milestone dates for the AEX:</p>
<p>    Index value     Date</p>
<p>    100		 Jan 2,  1983</p>
<p>    200		 Jan 22, 1985</p>
<p>    300		 June 2, 1989</p>
<p>    400		 Dec 20, 1993</p>
<p>    500		 Jan 3,  1996</p>
<p>    600		 Nov 13, 1996</p>
<p>    700		 Feb 11, 1997</p>
<p>    800		 May 16, 1997</p>
<p>    900		 July 3, 1997</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
